---
title: Translator F0 performance-equivalence methodology
---
flowchart LR
    A["Correctness gates pass<br/>DNS + destination + effective route + authorization + HTTP result"] --> B["Hold constant<br/>same VM, identity, custom FQDN, F0 account/backend<br/>fixed JSON request: 19 input characters"]
    B --> C["10 interleaved blocks<br/>5 in window A + 5 in window B<br/>windows separated by 30 minutes"]
    C --> D["Balanced mode order per block<br/>Public · Service Endpoint · Private Endpoint"]
    D --> E["At each boundary<br/>converge state · flush DNS/sockets<br/>capture route and endpoint state"]
    E --> F["Per mode and connection variant<br/>20 warm-up + 40 measured requests<br/>concurrency 1 · pacing 0.5 s"]
    F --> G["Variants<br/>fresh HTTPS connection<br/>reused HTTPS connection"]
    G --> H["Block aggregates<br/>p50 · p95 · jitter<br/>successful requests/s · input bytes/s<br/>errors · retransmission proxy"]
    H --> I{"Invalid block?<br/>CPU over 80%, credits depleted,<br/>throttling, destination drift,<br/>or transition incomplete"}
    I -->|Yes| J["Repeat the full block<br/>never one mode alone"]
    J --> C
    I -->|No| K["Pair block aggregates<br/>Public-SE · Public-PE · SE-PE"]
    K --> L["10,000 cluster-bootstrap resamples by block<br/>95% confidence intervals"]
    L --> M{"All predeclared primary margins established?"}
    M -->|Yes| N["Conditionally equivalent<br/>for this run, region, request, and time"]
    M -->|CI crosses a margin| O["Inconclusive"]
    M -->|Interval establishes outside margin| P["Not equivalent"]

    Q["Margins<br/>p50 + requests/s: ratio 0.90-1.10<br/>p95: 0.85-1.15<br/>jitter: 0.80-1.20 and absolute difference at most 2 ms<br/>errors: absolute difference at most 0.5 pp<br/>retransmission proxy: absolute difference at most 0.2 pp"] -.-> L
    R["F0 quota guard<br/>Concurrency 1 · small fixed request<br/>low-rate protocol within free-tier allowance"] -.-> F
    S["Interpretation guardrail<br/>Translator processing latency can dominate a small path delta<br/>equivalence may remain inconclusive<br/>no physical-path identity claim"] -.-> O

